        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>general or unspecified; prefer specifics, particularly <a href="/record/ui?ui=D006330" class="textLink_HEARTDEFECTSCONGENITAL">HEART DEFECTS, CONGENITAL</a>, or specific cardiovascular term <a id='abnorm' class='textLink_abnorm' href='/record/ui?ui=Q000002'>/&zwnj;abnorm</a></dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Congenital, inherited, or acquired anomalies of the <a href="/record/ui?ui=D002319" class="textLink_CARDIOVASCULARSYSTEM">CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM</a>, including the <a href="/record/ui?ui=D006321" class="textLink_HEART">HEART</a> and <a href="/record/ui?ui=D001808" class="textLink_BLOODVESSELS">BLOOD VESSELS</a>.</dd>
                </span>
            
            <dt>Entry Version</dt><dd>CARDIOVASC ABNORM</dd>
        
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Abnormalities, Cardiovascular
                    
                </dd>
